asset:        964-curves-rgb-s-curve-on-S.aep
title:        After Effects project fixture: a Curves effect with an S-shaped RGB curve on a PNG footage layer
author:       vangel76 (contributor)
source:       original work
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
added:        2026-10-19 by vangel76
notes:        Generated by the contributor with Adobe After Effects 2026 (the effect applied with an animation preset the contributor made by hand in After Effects) as their own test data for the effectcraft-aep tests; contains only synthetic project structure, no third-party footage (the footage link names a contributor-made test image that is not included; its stored path and host name were replaced by neutral ones of the same length), presets, templates or personal data. No Adobe sample project or asset was used. The project container is byte-identical to the generated file apart from that path; the XMP packet after it was replaced by the (smaller) packet of the base project to keep the fixtures small.
